{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1232333-nwod-as-a-musical","id":1232333,"title":"NWOD as a Musical","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-04T01:57:35-07:00","id":1232333,"title":"NWOD as a Musical","content":"That would be a show I would watch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23615-pierrew","name":"Pierrew","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-04T22:31:19-07:00","id":1232559,"title":"","content":"Mages always sing or rap in high-speed patter that makes Daveed Diggs look slow. At least one character breaks the fourth wall a little to ask them to slow down, for the audience's sake.<br /> <br /> Prometheans all start out with very simple melodies/motifs that gradually get more sophisticated as they make progress on their Pilgrimage.<br /> <br /> All the Demon songs are metal and electronica.<br /> <br /> Individual vampires and mummies get themes that reflect the popular music of the place/time in which they were Embraced or last active.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-05T04:51:19-07:00","id":1232590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"